WEBVTT

00:21:28.704 --> 00:21:31.871
but they will all be movies about
what it means to be human.

00:21:33.579 --> 00:21:39.288
Millions will feel all or fear, millions
will laugh and millions will cry,

00:21:40.371 --> 00:21:43.329
and then the lights will come back
on and they'll reemerge into

00:21:43.329 --> 00:21:45.204
the world they knew several hours prior.

00:21:45.746 --> 00:21:47.663
And millions of people will
look at the world

00:21:47.663 --> 00:21:53.454
a little bit differently than they did
when they went in by going to temple

00:21:53.788 --> 00:21:57.746
or a mosque or a church or any
other religious institution.

00:21:58.079 --> 00:22:01.163
Movie going is in many
ways a sacred ritual,